  "content": "![基因動物](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/acd46f4d9439230aa4ea7a7d89de91bb1f77e734.png)\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/898491e6dcb1c81cf06d45d277fbccbc88f94e0d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"42\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/4632b434c6cc220bb6727a350af1fe757f93a0aa.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"78\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/dae2d266a3bfe7bf94dc03a4b21f14085bb25594.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"77\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/04c2fa1cdce234a10222a90f155a615ba5d4a85c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/7ef62ace46b6b4aee7324b4479b14f8198972cc1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"53\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/68b7b83109b9eaea031a8ab509bf4e18073f97e0.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"123\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/f92ef545c139fb2d4128d0489064f7c518df55e0.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/94d744537c5b74985fd6c53c2b3b23080238eb7f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"75\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/0c5072deff1f17f040942444067416cca529b0a6.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"75\">\n\n</center>\n\n \n<center>\n\n![連結開始](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/9b16410efce4d8883b9ec5ae40ee64407c761bd4.png)<a title=\"維基\" href=\"https://minecraft-modsmc.fandom.com/wiki/Genetic_Animals\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/b9b35eb50cdb351a8629447077767438768941e6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"65\"></a><a title=\"基因動物Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/gTHExGMhFy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/7f5fb80c994ecb7f068ae96314ae801b27ed4448.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"65\"></a><a title=\"基因動物Youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@mokifox\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/4cf06c87661f3726f023c317895bed05384bcfc9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"65\"></a><a title=\"基因動物Patreon\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/genetic_animals\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/f8d560e869f0f23090d2d7450099b54b2eede825.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"198\" height=\"65\"></a>![連結結束](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DYjPZExA/images/653d9b1d5f1d602bac54f7b054c5559a7911fefa.png)\n\n\n</center>\n\n\n### 請查看維基或Discord以獲取更多資訊！\n\n基因動物模組為綿羊、牛、蘑菇牛、豬、兔子、雞、羊駝、烏龜、六角恐龍甚至花蘑菇牛提供了基於真實遺傳學的無限變種。所有馴養動物都有獨特的模型變異，每種動物都有分層紋理變化。每種動物還配有一套動畫，使牠們更貼近Minecraft最新生物的特性，讓遊戲體驗更加連貫。\n\n試試這個模組吧！如果你喜歡，請在Patreon上支持我！這真的很有幫助！",
